cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Spatial Transcriptomics Prep
abstract: The first step of the spatial transcriptomics workflows. Detects 10x Visium, Visium HD and
  Xenium, Vizgen MERSCOPE, NanoString CosMx, AnnData and SpatialData samples in a folder tree and writes
  one AnnData file per sample in a shared contract (raw counts, spatial coordinates, Visium images and
  scale factors, QC metrics with scanpy, control-probe counts, sample sheet columns and annotations),
  plus samples.csv and prep.json.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/st-prep
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- spatial-transcriptomics
- transcriptomics
- visium
- xenium
- merscope
- cosmx
- anndata
- preprocessing
